 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## smallpt (WebAssembly path tracer)
+
+The home page renders [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/) client-side. The C++ source
+lives in `wasm/smallpt.cpp` (lightly adapted: `main()` replaced with a JS-callable API) and is compiled
+with Emscripten into `public/smallpt/` (committed). Rendering is spread across Web Workers
+(`public/smallpt/worker.js`); the UI is `src/components/SmallptRenderer.astro`.
+
+To rebuild the WebAssembly after editing the C++ (requires `em++` on PATH):
+
+```sh
+pnpm run build:wasm
+```
